    "The two status lenses are static coloured geometry; runtime may tint/hide/swap them to reflect existing state.",
    "The scan/button/encoder clips are cosmetic examples. Antennas and side cover have separate groups, no functional radio internals.",
    "Test first/third person, both hands and GUI icon in the actual repository. Exact Minecraft display transforms have not been tested.",
    "Static geometry should be batched; do not create one entity per detail."
